{
  "name": "community-heroes",
  "summary": "Community patch (a community member's list, 16 Oct): Ethryn's shield (reflect width, look, Belroth's boulder, reflected Lamblaster), Rayo's Stormlense ramp, Astrada's Flame Cage in team colours",
