      "why": "Ethryn, Stalwart Aegis (E): the shield reflects projectiles only within her body's width (the box was 480 wide; its push on enemies walking through keeps today's size); the shield looks 15 % narrower and 10 % lower; a reflected Lamblaster (Wylde's E) deals one pellet's damage, like a normal Lamblaster hit, instead of full damage per pellet.",
